# AddressSanitizer suppressions. Every entry names its reason.

# AAX SDK bug, to report to Avid: AAX_CChunkDataParser::LoadChunk bounds-checks between elements but
# not within one, so a truncated or corrupt chunk reads past its end (value memcpys, the name, and a
# string value read to its NUL). The parser itself is built without ASan (root CMakeLists.txt); this
# covers the reads it makes through intercepted calls. Our side of SetChunk stays checked.
interceptor_via_fun:AAX_CChunkDataParser::LoadChunk
